- **a3 capillary-rheometer melt viscosity** is a high-pressure Hagen–Poiseuille remaining viscosity of a polymer extruder, not r66 Ubbelohde kinematic of a lube header, not r26 vibrating-wire viscometer, not r29/r34 Coriolis, not r49 FBRM, not r65 vibrating-tube density.

